──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
4) PRACTICAL GUIDANCE (NON-BINDING, FOR CLARITY)
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Allowed with Assets:
• Non-commercial sharing of the original, unmodified Assets with attribution to
  “Felipe Jovino” and a link to the CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 license.
• Technical changes needed for runtime (e.g., compression) that are not distributed
  as standalone “new” assets.

Not allowed with Assets:
• Commercial use by third parties (e.g., using the art/audio in a paid game).
• Distribution of modified Assets (e.g., recolors, edits, remixes, extractions as a pack).
• Publishing the Assets separately as a stock/asset pack, whether free or paid.

If you want a commercial or derivative-friendly license for the Assets, contact
the author to negotiate a separate license.

